{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "005d9c1ee888495dad9b12284f4801717efea2c557a37b66271883d3f1c6d5bb", "ja": "（今日は小さいイベントホールでのライブ。\n紬にとって初めての、外でのステージになるけど……）", "zh": "（今天是在小型活动会场举办的演唱会。\n这是紬第一次在外面的舞台上表演，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5ce9e7417c282e917741493c5acef9bb67defe059249a5b9a5f3588679da627c", "ja": "すぅ……はぁ……。\nはぁ。……はぁ。", "zh": "吸气……呼气……。\n呼…………呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1002_p", "source_sha256": "87f9b3b8858c320c2b34a2e5bfc9a6ff2f3f3226eef4a9db5c8d610c893b7eb4", "ja": "……紬、平気か？", "zh": "……紬，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1f9c25fc9338db3390a1190a95ebfaf511cd603cc0c7829ac9416bc1bca68315", "ja": "平気そうに、見えますか？", "zh": "我看起来，像没事人一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1af2c1edda697f63070c3780101af6dfa8900f076f1ee2023d6f8d42362e500e", "ja": "いや全然見えないけど、一応聞いてみようかと……。\nうん、思った以上に緊張してるみたいだな。", "zh": "看起来完全不像，不过我还是想先问问看……\n嗯，看来你比我想的还要紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "91f0ad2271cb467866f2a865fce888f859d2ab7319eca2e9387904759fd753c5", "ja": "みたいもなにもありません！　わからないのでしたら\n申し上げますが、私はとても、とても緊張しています！", "zh": "没有什么“好像”不好像的！既然您不知道，那我就直说了，我现在非常、非常紧张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "77f14c56d961b3e4c0e6f202bd76a0bc12762c69de4bef1909141b44d931c9b5", "ja": "わかった、心底よくわかった、ありがとう！\nでも、そこまで緊張しなくてもいいんだぞ？", "zh": "我知道了，我打心底完全明白了，谢谢你！\n不过，你也不用紧张到那个地步吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cf89e32b66cb418bff2f14df884a4364943e2dccc25918328a09e4be92100fee", "ja": "よくありません。私はまだまだアイドルとして半人前。\n歌もダンスも、他のみなさんに遠く及びません。", "zh": "不好。作为偶像，我还远远不够成熟。\n不论歌声还是舞蹈，都远比不上其他人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7938997553f60aed311b87fb5df5ebad294410c029bd09f4b4cfddc34f0aa323", "ja": "そんな私が、劇場の外に出て歌うなんて……。\nやはり、まだ早かったのではありませんか？", "zh": "像我这样的人，居然要走出剧场去唱歌……果然还是太早了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1336bbfe1781428b7930a0f6a20114085cd2a9659423c9041319f49f49e57529", "ja": "そんな事ないよ。紬ならもう十分、外に送り出せると\n思ったからこそ引き受けたんだ。自信を持ってくれ！", "zh": "没那回事。正因为我觉得紬已经完全可以走出剧场、独当一面了，所以才接下来的。拿出自信来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d54b66162096e7d97d39870ec59de44c0d2b84e8b67f199c5faa311fc360e0d0", "ja": "送り出す……？\nもしかして、私を劇場から追い出すつもりで……！？", "zh": "送出去……？\n难道您是打算把我赶出剧场……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9f7fbbb0778fbb8feea6361c361e4ff4dbe260186453f1cd0ba890e3344bb1ba", "ja": "違う違う。ええと……そう、紬をもっといろんな\n人に見てほしい、そう思ったんだ。", "zh": "不对不对。呃……对了，我是想让更多人看到紬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7356792c13730fdd36db987b0b3ba4eef15843fbd10d5b81b8a77110af3546c8", "ja": "私を……さらし者に……？", "zh": "要把我……当众出丑吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9d1873ea485fa1da707576041b7a3af4da96aad6f824e05690e40ce519faadb4", "ja": "違う違う違う！　ええと……そう、こんなにすごい\nアイドルがいるんですって、知らせたかったんだ！", "zh": "不是不是不是！呃……对了，我只是想让大家知道，原来有这么厉害的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5a1db2929183da11fb376c8a982c5441b498f5d2f091567dc7858b634d847363", "ja": "……。\nだとしたらそれは……、貴方の思い違いです。", "zh": "……。\n若是那样的话……那就是您的误解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5f02d3a6648f25e85d716dcb1b2cf7a028f82763a66ad5ecc71f3cf1a08c3c9f", "ja": "自分の至らなさは、誰よりもよくわかっています。\nすごいアイドルだなんて、とてもそんな……。", "zh": "我比谁都清楚自己的不足。说我是很厉害的偶像，实在是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "93eaae8086dde3b3242f156898ac07325cdb050e607ae01a51fd5c60fe1e343b", "ja": "まあ……自分の粗は目についちゃうかもだけど。\n悪い部分だけじゃなくて、良い部分も見て欲しいかな。", "zh": "也是……虽然可能会容易看到自己的缺点，\n不过我还是希望你不仅看不足的地方，也能多看看自己的长处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2e277718096b17a85235e0b5b3f4f229a6b01d289ce2c27f52fb5de55b6d77f1", "ja": "紬は今日まで、真面目にレッスンしてきたじゃないか。\nそれも自分が一番、よくわかってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "紬直到今天都一直认真地在练习，不是连这一点你自己都最清楚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4fa4b401fceb4a49ae7dbb17fc8d5b2e1f789a5da9d5d0319023ed8068cbed31", "ja": "それは……。そうです、けど……。", "zh": "那个……是的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1019_p", "source_sha256": "29b3ceaa0a1f5e45fbafbe69720d18d43b868b173507bc0ae82e21e1373c7aa0", "ja": "大丈夫、ちゃんとできてたから。\n自分がやってきたことを信じていこう！", "zh": "没事的，你表现得很好。\n要相信自己一路以来的努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "91db5ca91fb0e7725171604b918386784e1198ba70045b746497b2b7089c2c9e", "ja": "……。そう、ですね……。\nそれならば、少しは信じられる気がいたします。", "zh": "……。也，是呢……。\n既然如此，我感觉稍微能够去相信了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "96e057e32456576b2922b1d48111e35bb2c1347e2011239c9246b319b5978da1", "ja": "私が、積み重ねてきたレッスンを……。", "zh": "我……一直以来积累的练习……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cd0785a50c098b16cd2686424ce1f929e8921d77fd21fff1e735836fc92db89e", "ja": "（ふう）", "zh": "（呼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "22a1097a335db11c94ac4fdabfc12f71165ad9ed042b7e62686374c180d87d66", "ja": "{$P$}……あの。\nありがとうございました、少し……落ち着きました。", "zh": "{$P$}……那个。\n谢谢你，我稍微……冷静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4b474a1c10a30fad87631e7c47af8bfb9fe71269162b0965966aa310f15b25a5", "ja": "うん、よかったよ。……それにしても、\nどうも紬には、誤解されることが多いよな。", "zh": "嗯，那就好。……话说回来，\n我好像总被紬误解啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d14555889f7ab43094197f4469960f3d34bb99fc9bc6b1ae00715d9a257f27a5", "ja": "そんなに言い方が悪いかな？\nまあ、信用されてないだけかもしれないけど……はは。", "zh": "我的说法有那么糟糕吗？\n不过，也可能只是没被信任而已……哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ea43a3b9738830a44c88f3d7f9a8a049e820fa08d7ef416a5ce1ce434300af44", "ja": "……。\nそれは……逆です。", "zh": "……。\n那是……反过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1027_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9fc9087683c0a2863d0d9fb64ab32b1ce96ea8717532eacca8e11e5c758331c7", "ja": "いえ……その……。\n……。", "zh": "不……那个……  \n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6e10a377981cc982951ab48cdf9ba9c102131bffdb181c9108a3a2dc20b21539", "ja": "私は……貴方にいただいた言葉ひとつを信じて……。\nここまで参りました。ですから……その。", "zh": "我……相信着您对我说过的那一句话……\n才一路走到了现在。所以……那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "86dcd306367c8e8b4ec7697203fe2efc372ebf6f97182660168e31581704eee4", "ja": "あ、貴方が、本当にバカだったり、軽薄だったり、\n人でなしだったりすると……。困るげん……。", "zh": "啊，要是您真的是个笨蛋、轻浮的人，或者没人性的人……我会很为难的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5835d3297d71fe577e7aa9e55d93ae4e3e83b0480b886bdf2b1bd96ac64c028a", "ja": "そうか……。\nつまり頼ってもらえてる、って感じかな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n也就是说，我感觉自己是被依赖着的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3550418950352cff825c115c7214988359dc1995b361d298f75099009d057839", "ja": "それは、当たり前のことかと思います。\n貴方は私の……プロデューサーなのですから。", "zh": "我觉得那是理所当然的事。\n因为您是我的……制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "1a431f540c30fd838a4bfa19d7e6357e7b0229787a48e4023a95f7d3d2e40403", "ja": "そうだよな。でも、そう思ってくれてるのなら\n嬉しいよ。ありがとう、紬！", "zh": "是啊。不过，你愿意这么想，我很开心。谢谢你，紬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7a2c80a5842f67f95edfaf4cdf9333c9383b80b100152b7bdbcfc29ff9c9a851", "ja": "で、ですから、当たり前のことです。\nお礼なんて……いりません。", "zh": "所、所以说，这是理所当然的事。\n不用道谢……真的不需要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1035_p", "source_sha256": "814c6847af5ee2c6d9dd57863510db796e4de48938096c60e488d9a9b08c8d30", "ja": "とにかく、色々と勘違いさせてしまっているのは\n確かだよな。もっと安心して貰えるように頑張るよ！", "zh": "总之，确实让你产生了各种误会。为了让你能更安心，我会继续努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1036_051tmg", "source_sha256": "62136228984a2ba5761a635e052a45b5055d1429a35c2a91f532db85db34fe8a", "ja": "……。貴方という方は本当に、\n能天気というか、なんというか……。", "zh": "……。您这个人还真是，\n不知该说是乐天派呢，还是该说什么好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_005_1037_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d690ac67e159a23abc1f4127b47a8b4ed44fe9924e004721a8a7290645bdf3af", "ja": "なんだか気が抜けてしまいました。貴方には、\n乗せられてばかりのような気がします。", "zh": "不知怎么的，一下子泄了气。感觉自己总是被你牵着鼻子走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
